+            // BLOCKING call that can hang on MediaProjection release on some
+            // devices. disposeTrack runs on the shared WebRTC executor, so a
+            // hang here wedges EVERY subsequent getUserMedia/getDisplayMedia
+            // (they queue behind it and never run — the app then can't start
+            // any call until it is force-restarted). Dispose screen-capture
+            // tracks on a dedicated thread so the executor stays free; camera
+            // tracks (fast, non-blocking) keep disposing inline.
