+// -------- SYLK APP PATCH (patches/react-native-webrtc+124.0.7.patch) --------
+// Expose RTCAudioSession's manual-audio controls to JS so the app can drive
+// the VoIP audio unit deterministically from CallKit's
+// didActivate/didDeactivateAudioSession callbacks. Without this, WebRTC
+// auto-starts the audio unit when a track is ready, which races against
